<TITLE>Rear Towing Hook</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>A towing hook has been provided for recovery when the vehicle is stuck. Vehicles of the same class can be towed.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<WARNING>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Vehicles heavier than this vehicle cannot be towed. Attempting to tow a vehicle heavier than this vehicle may adversely affect the drivetrain or damage the towing hook or vehicle body.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></WARNING>
